## Interface: 120100
## Title: Djinni's Class Profiles
## Notes: Shows which druid specs want a dropped item, and what it does to your stat targets. Saves action bars and talent builds on every class. Season 2, The Venomous Abyss.
## Author: Djinni
## Version: 0.48.10
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Druid_Maul
## AddonCompartmentFunc: DjinnisClassProfiles_Toggle
## SavedVariables: DjinnisCPDB, DjinnisClassProfilesDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: DjinnisCPCharDB
## OptionalDeps: DjinnisBiS
## DefaultState: enabled
## X-Category: Raid & Loot

# Card 0058, the rename from DjinnisBiS. The stub DjinnisBiS folder loads the old
# saved data first, and PlanTab.moveSavedData copies it at login. DjinnisClassProfilesDB
# is the OLD Class Profiles addon's data, which lives in the file this folder name
# now owns: declared only so the game keeps it on disk. Nothing reads or writes it.

# Libraries. Listed directly rather than through an embeds.xml: four files do
# not need a manifest pointing at them.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua

DjinnisClassProfiles.lua
